TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution in acidic Cu-Ba solution at 200C

SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2.0
    pe        4.0
    units     mmol/kgw
    Cu        10.0
    Ba        5.0
    -water    1.0  # kg

KINETICS 1
Calcite
    -tol    1e-8
    -m0     1.0
    -m      1.0
    -parms  1.0  0.6
    -step   1000 in 100

INCREMENTAL_REACTIONS true

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file           calcite_kinetics.sel
    -reset          false
    -step
    -time
    -totals         C Cu Ba Ca
    -molalities     CO3-2 HCO3- H2CO3 CaCO3 Cu+2 Cu+ CuOH+ Cu(OH)2 CuCO3

END
